{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週刊少年チャンピオンさんの\nグラビア撮影でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて週刊少年チャンピオンさんに\n登場します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月4日発売です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現場もすごく楽しくて\n撮影以外のお昼ご飯の時も\n話が止まらなくて\n本当にたのしかったな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真もすごく素敵にとってもらったので\n完成がたのしみ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、みなさんみてくださいね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影ってやっぱりすごく楽しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/1701845/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/1701845/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はみがきちゅー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/1701845/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は最初少し薄暗かったけど\nお昼に近づくにつれ\nどんどん明るくなってきて\n撮影が終わる頃にはポカポカしてたから\nちょっと日向ぼっこしました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きもちよかったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり天気がいいって\nそれだけで気持ちいいですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの好きな季節はいつですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のメイクさんに好きな季節を聞かれたから私も気になりました。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/1701845/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の日曜日は握手会ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭が行われる予定ときいているので\nいつもの握手会よりも\n緊張します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、その場で皆さんへの気持ちを\n考えて伝えたらごちゃごちゃになっちゃうと思うから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えていこうかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段からの感謝の気持ちを！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られる方はぜひみにきてください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部終わりにあります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}